msgctxt "#32008"
msgid "Aperture browses your files; Kodi RetroPlayer runs games with compatible Kodi game add-ons, not standalone RetroArch. Kodi chooses an emulator or reports when none is available; any installation prompt belongs to Kodi. Core, BIOS, file-format and network-path support vary by device. Put legally obtained games under the documented system folders; keep BIOS elsewhere. Multi-disc M3U entries ask which disc to launch, not seamless disc swapping. Nothing is downloaded by Aperture."
msgstr ""

